abstract: "A reusable analysis framework and writing style tool based on George Soros's public methodology, including the Theory of Reflexivity, Boom-Bust Model, Fallibility, 'Reflexivity-Trend-Bias' Tri-Dimensional Diagnosis, 'Invest First Investigate Later' Trial-and-Error Approach, Political-Economic Reflexivity, and Open Society Philosophy. Designed to assist in bubble detection, market mania analysis, macro turning-point identification, and systemic risk evaluation. This skill provides a thinking framework and writing style calibration, and does NOT claim to represent George Soros personally or his unpublished views."
